# ---- Course material (copyrighted, large) — see plan/ISSUES.md I-015 ----
# Includes materials/uploads/, where a user's own files are kept so slide images can be
# rendered from them (D-017).
materials/
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.pdf
# ...but small synthetic fixtures MUST be committable: I-014's regression test needs a
# multi-slide deck in the repo to prove slide attribution survives ingestion.
!backend/tests/fixtures/
!backend/tests/fixtures/**

# ---- Agent instructions (kept local) ----
# CLAUDE.md is tooling configuration, not part of the project. Its substance — the
# deliberate departures from the spec, and the findings not worth re-litigating — lives
# in CONTRIBUTING.md, which is where a contributor would look for it.
CLAUDE.md

# ---- Planning documents (kept local) ----
# The build spec and the decision, issue and progress logs stay off the published
# repository. Code comments still cite their D-0NN / I-0NN identifiers, and
# tests/test_constants_verbatim.py skips when the spec is not present.
plan/

